endorsed or supported by Sophos.

src/vendor/sophos-core is vendored from @notfusion/sophos-core (NotFusion,
Copyright 2026 Aaron Jacobs), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 AND the
MIT License. Both notices are kept beside it: src/vendor/sophos-core/LICENSE
(Apache-2.0) and LICENSE-MIT. Parts of it are adapted from
sophos-central-mcp-server (https://github.com/Aaronjacobs000/sophos-mcp), MIT
License. The exporter's local changes to those files are listed in
ATTRIBUTIONS.md.

src/sophos/guard.ts, src/sophos/limiter.ts and src/datasets/sensor-labels.ts
are adapted from the SecOps Toolkit
(https://github.com/Aaronjacobs000/sophos-secops-toolkit), MIT License.

schemas/fusion/*.graphql are copies of the public Sophos Fusion GraphQL
schemas (Cases v2 and Detections v2) from developer.sophos.com, used to
validate the exporter's queries in tests. They describe Sophos's APIs and
remain Sophos's material; this project's licence does not cover them.

